OL,3,GNEWSAPM urged to intervene over
OL,4,Ahelicopter disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Huddersfield man whose father was
OL,7,Fkilled when an RAF helicopter crashed
OL,8,Fin Scotland in 1994 has called on the
OL,9,Fprime minister to support a new
OL,10,Findependent inquiry into the disaster.
OL,12,FThe crash on the Mull of Kintyre killed
OL,13,F25 intelligence experts and four
OL,14,Fspecial forces crew, including RUC
OL,15,Fofficer Det Ch Supt Maurice McLaughlin
OL,16,FNeilly.
OL,18,FThe victims' families challenged Andy
OL,19,FBurnham to meet with them within his
OL,20,Ffirst 100 days in office - which he
OL,21,Fwill reach next week.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
